<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
  <title>KAIZEN — Services</title>
</head>
<body class="app-page">
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>
  <main class="app-main">
    <div class="page-header">
      <div>
        <h1>Services</h1>
        <p class="page-sub">What Kaizen offers traders</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:2px;">
      <div class="card card-gold">
        <div class="card-header"><h2>Discipline Tracking</h2></div>
        <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.8;">
          Track your rule compliance across every session. Your Discipline Score (0-100)
          is calculated from real behavioral data — not P&L.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header"><h2>Trading Journal</h2></div>
        <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.8;">
          Log every session with asset, timeframe, emotion, direction, outcome,
          and compliance data. Build a complete picture of your trading behavior.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-blue">
        <div class="card-header"><h2>ZA Bounties</h2></div>
        <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.8;">
          Access live Zero Authority DAO bounties directly inside Kaizen.
          Complete discipline challenges to earn on-chain reputation and STX rewards.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header"><h2>On-Chain Reputation</h2></div>
        <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.8;">
          Your trading discipline is verified on-chain through Zero Authority DAO.
          Build a reputation that follows you across the Web3 ecosystem.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header"><h2>Chart Analysis — Phase 2</h2></div>
        <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.8;">
          Full TradingView-style charting with drawing tools and real-time
          Bybit market data. Coming in Phase 2.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header"><h2>AI Mentor — Phase 2</h2></div>
        <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.8;">
          Kaizen AI watches your chart analysis, learns your trading style,
          and enforces the rules you defined. Silent, firm, supportive.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <script src="/js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
